e = /*--scanner smb*/i or CommandLine = /*--scanner smb3querynetwork*/i or CommandLine = /*--scanner spooler*/i or CommandLine = /*--scanner startup*/i or CommandLine = /*--scanner zerologon*/i)) or (CommandLine = /*--no-enum-limit*/i) or ((CommandLine = /*--healthcheck*/i and CommandLine = /*--level Full*/i)) or ((CommandLine = /*--healthcheck*/i and CommandLine = /*--server */i))))
